  "idea": "Stirling-PDF: 100 percent free open-source PDF power tool",
  "text": "If you work with documents daily, bookmark this free tool right now. Converting scanned receipts into editable tables or compiling client pitch decks usually requires three different websites. That chaotic workflow fragments your file storage and leaves confidential client drafts scattered across random cloud servers. Stirling-PDF consolidates file conversion, page rotation, watermarking, and redaction inside one unified offline dashboard. Your team handles heavy document edits with zero security risks.",
